<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">One Weekend</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œYeah, yeah. Youâ€™re both very cute and soooo in love. Itâ€™s gross.â€ Glimmer says and Adora can see her bestieâ€™s fond eye roll perfectly from even over the phone. â€œSo, you two ready to fuck yet orâ€¦?â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;"Glimmer! Adora and Catraâ€™s private life are their own." Bow's voice cuts in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œYeah, I think we will.â€ Adora canâ€™t even believe how sure of herself she sounds with her answer. But with how easily she and Catra have fit together in just a few short weeks of dating, it just seems right that they might end up in bed together tonight. Especially with Catra staying over at her apartment for the first time... Adora can only imagine what the two of them will do with an entire weekend alone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For Jezmatron, for the #SPOPSmutSwap, a smut exchange happening from Feb 14th-21st as part of the SPOPCreativeFlex.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
